## API reference

### DropdownMenu

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `size:` | `:sm`, `:md`, `:lg` | `:md` | Rows, labels and popup radius. |
| `open_on_hover:` | `Boolean` | `false` | Open when the pointer rests on the trigger. |
| `delay:` / `close_delay:` | `Integer` | `100` | Hover open / close delays in ms. |

Events (prefix `ui--dropdown-menu:`): `select` { item, label }, `checked-change` { item, checked }, `value-change`
{ group, value }, `open-change` { open }.

### DropdownMenuContent

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `side:` | `:bottom`, `:top`, `:inline_end`, `:inline_start` | `:bottom` | Preferred side (flips when there's no room). |
| `align:` | `:start`, `:center`, `:end` | `:start` | Alignment along that side. |
| `side_offset:` / `align_offset:` | `Integer` | `6` / `0` | Gaps in px. |

### Items

| Part | Props | Description |
|------|-------|-------------|
| `DropdownMenuItem` | `disabled:`, `close_on_click:` (`true`), `label:` | An action; `label:` is what typeahead matches. |
| `DropdownMenuCheckboxItem` | `checked:`, `disabled:` | Toggles; keeps the menu open. |
| `DropdownMenuRadioGroup` | `value:`, `name:` | Holds the radio items. |
| `DropdownMenuRadioItem` | `value:`, `disabled:` | One option. |
| `DropdownMenuLinkItem` | `href:` + anchor attributes | A link. |
| `DropdownMenuSubContent` | `side_offset:` (`12`) | A submenu popup beside its trigger. |

## Accessibility

- The trigger has `aria-haspopup="menu"` / `aria-expanded`; the popup is a `role="menu"` of `menuitem`,
  `menuitemcheckbox` and `menuitemradio` rows.
- ↓ / Enter / Space open it on the first item, ↑ on the last; arrows, Home / End and typeahead move; → / ← open and
  close submenus (mirrored in RTL); Escape closes a level and returns focus; Tab closes.
- Enter and exit transitions honor `prefers-reduced-motion`.
